# Pictures pnpm deploy:images downloads from a site, to ship as static files: the owner's, never committed
public/media/

# The landing page's dashboard screenshots, made by pnpm shots: on the maintainer's computer and on fluxbio.link,
# from where pnpm landing:pictures fetches the ones a checkout lacks
landing/public/*/dash-*.webp

# The Chinese font pnpm landing:fonts cuts to the landing page's characters: made again by each deploy
landing/.fonts/

# Skills stay on the maintainer's computer: nobody hosting FluxBio needs them
.claude/skills/
skills-lock.json

